@elmarco I have taken a look at your issues with the CI tests. It seems to me that [this test](https://github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/master/test/test-network/systemd-networkd-tests.py) is failing because it is not properly configured for your additional features. To be exact [these lines](https://github.com/elmarco/systemd/blob/5a20b6cb431b4991d184b387d492da69e398b079/src/network/networkctl.c#L1140-L1146) are always failing in the tests. And because of that the [link_status_one](https://github.com/elmarco/systemd/blob/5a20b6cb431b4991d184b387d492da69e398b079/src/network/networkctl.c#L1338) never [ finishes correctly](https://github.com/elmarco/systemd/blob/5a20b6cb431b4991d184b387d492da69e398b079/src/network/networkctl.c#L1975-L1987).

The function fails with the message `Failed to query link DHCP leases: Unknown interface org.freedesktop.network1.DHCPServer or property Leases.`

So maybe adjust the [test](https://github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/master/test/test-network/systemd-networkd-tests.py) or make the dump_dhcp_leases function optional. Hope this helps.
